docs:
Formic 0.5.0 is in src/formic/. Wire the stylesheet stack in your CSS entry, in this order:
  @import "./formic/styles/fonts.css";
  @import "tailwindcss";
  @import "./formic/styles/formic.css";
Then run python3 src/formic/scripts/apply_config.py once (it applies src/formic/formic.config.json: accent, html attributes, component defaults). Add components with npx formicai add <name> (or add https://formicai.dev/r/<name>.json with the registry client) — the list is at https://formicai.dev/r/registry.json; https://formicai.dev/r/formic-all.json installs all of them. Read AGENTS.md before building UI.

